== #text(font: "DM Serif Display")[FOUNDED IN 2017 IN THE _UNITED STATES_ BY #text(fill: rgb("#FFFDD0"))[*TRAVIS SCOTT*], AKA JACQUES BERMON WEBSTER]

In March 2017, #text(fill: rgb("#FFFDD0"))[Travis Scott] announced in an interview that he was creating his own record label,
#text(fill: rgb("#FFFDD0"))[*CACTUS JACK RECORDS*], so that he could help new artists with potential,
just as #text(fill: rgb("#BBBBBB"))[KANYE WEST] and #text(fill: rgb("#6FA8FF"))[KID CUDI] had helped him.

TRAVIS was discovered by #text(fill: rgb("#BBBBBB"))[KANYE], who opened up the world of rap and production to him.
#text(fill: rgb("#6FA8FF"))[KID CUDI] helped him a lot to make music outside the box. In 2012 he signed
with #text(fill: rgb("#BBBBBB"))[Kanye]'s label G.O.O.D. Music as a producer.

He was key to the compilation YEEZUS and CRUEL SUMMER, where his touch
left an important mark. From then on, #text(fill: rgb("#BBBBBB"))[KANYE] became his official mentor,
both musically and visually.

From this bond among the three came the first iconic collaborations, such as:
Through the Late Night (2016), a track from the album _Birds in the Trap Sing McKnight_
with #text(fill: rgb("#6FA8FF"))[KID CUDI], and in 2020 the single THE SCOTTS with #text(fill: rgb("#6FA8FF"))[KID CUDI],
which reached number one on the Billboard chart.

With KANYE WEST a collaboration was born that led to worldwide hits such as
PRAISE GOD, which is on #text(fill: rgb("#BBBBBB"))[KANYE]'s album DONDA.

== The help of #text(fill: rgb("#BBBBBB"))[KANYE] and #text(fill: rgb("#6FA8FF"))[KID CUDI]

The help of YE and KID CUDI was very important in creating
#text(fill: rgb("#FFFDD0"))[*_CACTUS JACK RECORDS_*].

On March 10, #text(fill: rgb("#FF6B6B"))[DON TOLIVER] signed with the label after #text(fill: rgb("#FFFDD0"))[TRAVIS] featured
him on the track CAN'T SAY, from the album #text(fill: rgb("#FFE066"))[ASTROWORLD],
which reached number one on the BILLBOARD 200.

On November 19, 2019, #text(fill: rgb("#FFFDD0"))[TRAVIS] announced the label's first compilation,
titled #text(fill: rgb("#C2C26B"))[JACKBOYS], with #text(fill: rgb("#FFFDD0"))[TRAVIS SCOTT], #text(fill: rgb("#FF6B6B"))[DON TOLIVER],
#text(fill: lime)[SHECK WES] and #text(fill: rgb("#C77DFF"))[SoFaygo].

